# Third-Party Vendored Code and Assets

This package includes the following third-party components, each licensed under
compatible open-source licenses as noted below.

## 1. Flag Icons (SVG)

**Source:** https://github.com/lipis/flag-icons  
**Version:** 7.5.0 (tag v7.5.0, commit 086f7e97d657358203916dbe84f61c2bccaa81eb, 2026-05-29)  
**License:** MIT (see below)  
**Location:** `inst/app/www/flags/` (4x3 aspect ratio variants)

The flag SVG files are vendored to eliminate the dependency on the `flagon` R
package (a GitHub-only wrapper), which itself bundled flag-icons assets. A subset
of flag-icons' full 270+ country/region flag SVGs was vendored based on the actual
ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 codes used by `pressfreedom.data::rwb_standardized`.

