## 2. ggbump Geometry Functions

**Source:** https://github.com/davidsjoberg/ggbump  
**Version:** Main branch (commit fe6d5c7, 2025)  
**License:** MIT (see below)  
**Location:** `inst/app/R/geom_bump_vendored.R`  
**Author:** David Sjöberg

The core bump-chart geometry functions (`sigmoid()`, `rank_sigmoid()`, 
`geom_bump()`, and their supporting ggproto objects) are vendored to eliminate
the dependency on the `ggbump` R package, which was archived from CRAN on
2025-12-04. Functions and ggproto classes are renamed with a `pf_` prefix
(e.g., `pf_geom_bump()`, `PfStatBump`) to avoid conflicts if ggbump is ever
revived as a dependency.

