## Summary

Both vendored components are MIT-licensed. Pressfreedom itself is also
MIT-licensed, making these vendored components fully compatible. The vendoring
resolves two problematic runtime dependencies:

1. **flagon** (GitHub-only, wraps flag-icons) → replaced by direct SVG assets
2. **ggbump** (GitHub-only, archived from CRAN) → replaced by vendored functions

This eliminates external GitHub dependencies for CRAN review while maintaining
the original functionality and appearance of the application.
